No verified public benchmark scores found for Qwen 3.8 specifically. The Qwen 3 family inherits Qwen 2.5's strong multilingual coding heritage. The 3.x version number indicates iterative improvements over the 3.0 base model. General Qwen benchmarks show strong multilingual and coding performance.

